@startuml
title State diagram for BPO Management System Search Scenario

[*] --> InitialState : Start

state "Initial" as InitialState
InitialState : entry / start state

state "FilterSelection" as FilterSelection
FilterSelection : entry / selected filter category or price range
FilterSelection : do / display matching users based on chosen criteria

FilterSelection --> InitialState : clear filters

InitialState --> FilterSelection : select filter category
InitialState --> FilterSelection : select price range

FilterSelection --> FinalState : search completed

state "Final" as FinalState
FinalState : entry / end state

@enduml
